WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.767 --> 00:00:03.035
-Welcome back to the attic
crawl space, everybody.

00:00:03.035 --> 00:00:04.837
Now, as you may know,

00:00:04.837 --> 00:00:08.207
there's been some speculation
online about what's behind

00:00:08.207 --> 00:00:10.610
my tiny little door back there.

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:14.013
And I just want to put
one of the rumors to rest.

00:00:14.013 --> 00:00:16.883
I do not keep my children
in there

00:00:16.883 --> 00:00:18.618
so they won't interrupt me
while I'm filming.

00:00:18.618 --> 00:00:20.787
For one,
that would be very cruel.

00:00:20.787 --> 00:00:22.688
And two,
it's a shallow closet.

00:00:22.688 --> 00:00:24.323
You would never fit
both of them.

00:00:24.323 --> 00:00:26.192
Which is something you can tell
from eyeballing.

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:28.127
I didn't try.

00:00:28.127 --> 00:00:29.495
You can't lock it
from the outside.

00:00:29.495 --> 00:00:31.064
Look, there are
a lot of reasons.

00:00:31.064 --> 00:00:33.432
But the main one is
it would be cruel.

00:00:33.432 --> 00:00:36.836
Also, it's been pointed out
that the number of copies

00:00:36.836 --> 00:00:40.473
of "The Thorn Birds" on
my side table kept increasing.

00:00:40.473 --> 00:00:42.475
At one point there was one copy,
then two,

00:00:42.475 --> 00:00:44.310
then a third copy seemed
to appear out of nowhere.

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:45.779
It was very strange.

00:00:45.779 --> 00:00:47.680
So we had our guy
come to check it out.

00:00:47.680 --> 00:00:49.649
He said it's pretty common
in old attic

00:00:49.649 --> 00:00:53.086
to have an infestation of what
he called "mini-series books."

00:00:53.086 --> 00:00:56.255
He said at one point,
there was likely an aunt

00:00:56.255 --> 00:00:57.957
of some sort up here.

00:00:57.957 --> 00:01:00.794
But he sprayed.
We're back down to one.

00:01:00.794 --> 00:01:05.298
And he said everything will be
back to normal in a week or two,

00:01:05.298 --> 00:01:07.367
while also stressing
you have to be patient

00:01:07.367 --> 00:01:09.502
with a problem like this and,
you know, you can't rush it.

00:01:09.502 --> 00:01:13.038
And yet while I'm being patient
with my "Thorn Birds" books,

00:01:13.038 --> 00:01:15.308
the president is already getting
ready to reopen the economy

00:01:15.308 --> 00:01:16.843
after a bombshell
"New York Times" report

00:01:16.843 --> 00:01:19.779
revealed more details
about how he ignored the threat

00:01:19.779 --> 00:01:21.848
posed by the coronavirus.
That's a segue.

00:01:21.848 --> 00:01:24.750
For more on this, it's time
for "A Closer Look."

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:28.688
♪♪

00:01:28.688 --> 00:01:31.124
As we've already detailed,
the president ignored

00:01:31.124 --> 00:01:33.659
repeated warnings
over the course of several years

00:01:33.659 --> 00:01:35.828
that a pandemic like this
was coming,

00:01:35.828 --> 00:01:37.030
that it could kill
lots of people,

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:38.998
and that it could
devastate the economy.

00:01:38.998 --> 00:01:41.200
Then he lied about it,
said it would go away,

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:43.203
pushed a miracle cure
that doctors have said

00:01:43.203 --> 00:01:45.205
could have potentially
lethal side effects,

00:01:45.205 --> 00:01:47.539
and is now telling everyone
things could just

00:01:47.539 --> 00:01:50.110
go back to normal after
tens of thousands have died

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:52.211
and 17 million
have lost their jobs,

00:01:52.211 --> 00:01:54.246
or as the president put it...

00:01:54.246 --> 00:01:58.017
-We have done a job the likes
of which nobody has seen.

00:01:58.017 --> 00:02:00.319
And you should say
"Congratulations. Great job."

00:02:00.319 --> 00:02:02.688
instead of being, uh, so horrid

00:02:02.688 --> 00:02:04.257
in the way you ask a question.

00:02:04.257 --> 00:02:06.191
-Well, I will congratulate you

00:02:06.191 --> 00:02:07.927
on bringing back
the word "horrid."

00:02:07.927 --> 00:02:11.263
Really nice work on that,
Mrs. Thurston Howell.

00:02:11.263 --> 00:02:14.734
You think they should say
"Congratulations. Great job"?

00:02:14.734 --> 00:02:16.902
I think you're confusing
a press conference

00:02:16.902 --> 00:02:18.371
with a party of some kind.

00:02:18.371 --> 00:02:19.772
[ As Trump ] Not only
are your questions horrid,

00:02:19.772 --> 00:02:22.041
you never bring balloons.

00:02:22.041 --> 00:02:24.410
It's been a month.
Not a single cake.

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:26.479
Have you guys not heard
of piñatas,

00:02:26.479 --> 00:02:29.615
or have you and you just don't
like them 'cause you hate fun?

00:02:29.615 --> 00:02:31.884
Yeah, you hate fun, I said it.

00:02:31.884 --> 00:02:33.419
[ Normal voice ] But yeah,

00:02:33.419 --> 00:02:35.021
next time we can bring out
a cake that says

00:02:35.021 --> 00:02:37.190
"Congratulations on only
17 million unemployed."

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:39.926
Seriously, we could,
because in the last month or so,

00:02:39.926 --> 00:02:42.694
we've all gotten pretty good
at baking.

00:02:42.694 --> 00:02:45.097
Not great at ironing.

00:02:45.097 --> 00:02:46.966
But pretty good at baking.

00:02:46.966 --> 00:02:48.167
And then we found out
over the weekend

00:02:48.167 --> 00:02:49.735
about yet another
series of warnings

00:02:49.735 --> 00:02:51.838
when "The New York Times"
published a blockbuster account

00:02:51.838 --> 00:02:53.739
of how Trump ignored the crisis
for months

00:02:53.739 --> 00:02:56.976
as well as e-mails from medical
experts and government officials

00:02:56.976 --> 00:02:59.178
talking about the danger
of what was happening.

00:02:59.178 --> 00:03:01.747
One infectious disease doctor,
James Lawler,

00:03:01.747 --> 00:03:04.117
who served in the White House
under President Bush

00:03:04.117 --> 00:03:06.218
and as an adviser
to President Obama

00:03:06.218 --> 00:03:08.721
wrote in one e-mail that
the government's slow response

00:03:08.721 --> 00:03:11.391
was "like ignoring
the smoke detector

00:03:11.391 --> 00:03:13.826
and waiting until
your entire house is on fire

00:03:13.826 --> 00:03:15.327
to call the fire department."

00:03:15.327 --> 00:03:16.762
And in another, he wrote,

00:03:16.762 --> 00:03:18.597
"Pilots can tell you
what happens

00:03:18.597 --> 00:03:21.467
when a crew makes decisions
based on intuition

00:03:21.467 --> 00:03:24.236
rather than what their
instruments are telling them."

00:03:24.236 --> 00:03:26.339
Among the many horrifying parts
of that story

00:03:26.339 --> 00:03:28.608
is imagining Trump
as an airline pilot.

00:03:28.608 --> 00:03:31.243
If Trump had been flying during
the Miracle on the Hudson,

00:03:31.243 --> 00:03:34.713
we would be calling it the
"Fireball on the East River."

00:03:34.713 --> 00:03:36.682
And he would have spent
the whole time blaming the geese

00:03:36.682 --> 00:03:38.051
and yelling at the passengers,

00:03:38.051 --> 00:03:40.253
[ As Trump ] You know,
instead of screaming

00:03:40.253 --> 00:03:41.754
and putting on
your oxygen masks,

00:03:41.754 --> 00:03:43.522
you should be saying,
"Congratulations.

00:03:43.522 --> 00:03:45.024
Great job, Captain."

00:03:45.024 --> 00:03:47.727
[ Normal voice ] It's going to
make a great movie.

00:03:47.727 --> 00:03:50.763
We also considered
sullen and bully,

00:03:50.763 --> 00:03:52.831
but we thought in your head
you might hear "bulley,"

00:03:52.831 --> 00:03:55.134
and no one wants that.

00:03:55.134 --> 00:03:57.970
Again, what we're experiencing
now was not inevitable.

00:03:57.970 --> 00:03:59.405
In those same e-mails,

00:03:59.405 --> 00:04:03.676
Lawler noted that pandemic
response planning began in 2006

00:04:03.676 --> 00:04:06.412
under the Bush administration
and wrote that we could have

00:04:06.412 --> 00:04:08.547
followed the examples
set by Hong Kong

00:04:08.547 --> 00:04:10.016
and Singapore where
the outbreaks

00:04:10.016 --> 00:04:11.584
were effectively contained.

00:04:11.584 --> 00:04:14.954
Lawler wrote of the mistakes the
government was making in March,

00:04:14.954 --> 00:04:18.424
"We had systematically addressed
all of these and had a plan

00:04:18.424 --> 00:04:21.560
that would work and has worked
in Hong Kong/Singapore.

00:04:21.560 --> 00:04:24.230
We have thrown 15 years
of institutional learning

00:04:24.230 --> 00:04:27.733
out the window and are making
decisions based on intuition."

00:04:27.733 --> 00:04:30.602
Of course he threw 15 years
of learning out the window.

00:04:30.602 --> 00:04:32.438
That's probably what
his high school tutor said

00:04:32.438 --> 00:04:34.506
when they tried to help him
study for the SATs.

00:04:34.506 --> 00:04:38.010
Donald, can you read these
vocabulary words for me?

00:04:38.010 --> 00:04:41.780
-10,000 known or suspested
gang members.

00:04:41.780 --> 00:04:43.916
Advising law markers.

00:04:43.916 --> 00:04:46.385
Will not be tolerited.

00:04:46.385 --> 00:04:48.654
Distribution of urgenshy.

00:04:48.654 --> 00:04:51.124
-[ Sighs ]
I feel as though I've thrown

00:04:51.124 --> 00:04:53.492
15 years of learning
out the window.

00:04:53.492 --> 00:04:54.894
[ As Trump ] What's a window?

00:04:54.894 --> 00:04:57.196
Oh, you mean
the glassy square hole?

00:04:57.196 --> 00:04:58.664
Anyway, don't worry, teach,

00:04:58.664 --> 00:05:01.867
my intuition tells me my dad is
going to buy my way into Pennis.

00:05:01.867 --> 00:05:05.171
[ Normal voice ]
It's not Pennis. It's Penn!

00:05:05.171 --> 00:05:08.240
[ As Trump ]
[ Chuckles ] You said "pennis."

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:10.676
[ Normal voice ] And now,
the same president who ignored

00:05:10.676 --> 00:05:12.211
repeated warnings
from medical experts

00:05:12.211 --> 00:05:14.513
and intelligence officials
about the crisis,

00:05:14.513 --> 00:05:16.516
then instead just
went with his intuition,

00:05:16.516 --> 00:05:19.151
is once again telling people
he's going to decide

00:05:19.151 --> 00:05:22.287
to reopen the economy soon
based on his instincts.

00:05:22.287 --> 00:05:26.159
Over the weekend, he called into
his favorite Fox News shout fest

00:05:26.159 --> 00:05:28.794
with Jeanine Pirro
to discuss his thinking

00:05:28.794 --> 00:05:30.329
for when to reopen the economy,

00:05:30.329 --> 00:05:32.497
