00:05:32.497 --> 00:05:35.034
-I know you said that
the decision that you'll make,

00:05:35.034 --> 00:05:37.570
uh, regarding reopening
the country

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:40.139
is probably the hardest
decision, uh,

00:05:40.139 --> 00:05:42.241
