called to make.

00:05:42.241 --> 00:05:45.812
Uh, when you make that decision,

00:05:45.812 --> 00:05:48.247
I mean, where do you go
within you?

00:05:48.247 --> 00:05:52.384
What is it that you dig deep for
to come up with a decision,

00:05:52.384 --> 00:05:55.688
