surrounding you?

00:05:55.688 --> 00:05:57.690
-Well, Jeanine, I think
it's going to be

00:05:57.690 --> 00:06:00.059
the toughest decision
that I've ever made,

00:06:00.059 --> 00:06:01.760
and I'll be basing it
on a lot of --

00:06:01.760 --> 00:06:04.930
a lot of very smart people,
a lot of professionals,

00:06:04.930 --> 00:06:07.867
doctors, and, uh,
business leaders.

00:06:07.867 --> 00:06:10.336
There are a lot of things that
go into a decision like that.

00:06:10.336 --> 00:06:12.705
And, uh,
it's going to be, uh --

00:06:12.705 --> 00:06:14.807
It's going to be based
on a lot of facts

00:06:14.807 --> 00:06:16.975
and a lot of instinct, also.

00:06:16.975 --> 00:06:20.113
Whether we like it or not, there
is a certain instinct to it.

00:06:20.113 --> 00:06:22.348
-There's instinct involved?

00:06:22.348 --> 00:06:23.916
Are you making
a political decision,

00:06:23.916 --> 00:06:26.652
