the president, not a mystery.

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:58.551
Also stop making it sound like
a big reality show finale.

00:06:58.551 --> 00:06:59.952
[ As Trump ]
I'll be making a decision,

00:06:59.952 --> 00:07:01.654
