00:07:18.837 --> 00:07:20.940
[ Normal voice ] Also, Jeanine,
what kind of question is this?

00:07:20.940 --> 00:07:22.875
-Where do you go within you?

00:07:22.875 --> 00:07:27.180
What is it that you dig deep for
