[ As Trump ] What do I want?

00:07:46.398 --> 00:07:48.667
Brain, heart, courage.
You name it.

00:07:48.667 --> 00:07:51.337
Who am I?
You can call me Tin-Crow-Lion."

00:07:51.337 --> 00:07:53.673
♪ I'd be President forever ♪

00:07:53.673 --> 00:07:56.442
♪ So handsome and so clever
if I only had ♪

00:07:56.442 --> 00:07:57.743
