00:10:27.827 --> 00:10:30.229
asked a medical expert
whether Trump's late start

00:10:30.229 --> 00:10:32.431
to confronting the virus
cost lives,

00:10:32.431 --> 00:10:34.833
Trump lashed out at him
with a tweet saying,

00:10:34.833 --> 00:10:37.436
"What the hell is happening
to Fox News?

00:10:37.436 --> 00:10:39.805
It's a whole new ball game
over there."

00:10:39.805 --> 00:10:42.408
After everything Fox News
has done for Trump,

00:10:42.408 --> 00:10:44.242
he still complains about them.

00:10:44.242 --> 00:10:46.845
The only news show
he wouldn't criticize

00:10:46.845 --> 00:10:49.881
would be a topless woman who
reads his tweets without comment

00:10:49.881 --> 00:10:51.550
and then fakes an orgasm.

00:10:51.550 --> 00:10:53.219
[ As Trump ]
Boob News continues to be

00:10:53.219 --> 00:10:56.155
the only fair network out there.

00:10:56.155 --> 00:11:00.158
A lot of good work
being done at BN."

00:11:00.158 --> 00:11:03.128
[ Normal voice ]
To stay in Trump's inner circle,

00:11:03.128 --> 00:11:04.530
you have to praise him
without exception,

00:11:04.530 --> 00:11:07.933
which is something Trump's
unwatered Chia Pet Rudy Giuliani

00:11:07.933 --> 00:11:09.268
understands better than most.

00:11:09.268 --> 00:11:11.103
Rudy actually offered
some advice recently

00:11:11.103 --> 00:11:14.172
to governors and local officials
who had been feuding with Trump

00:11:14.172 --> 00:11:16.408
over the fact that Trump
has refused to supply them

00:11:16.408 --> 00:11:18.610
with adequate equipment,
including ventilators

00:11:18.610 --> 00:11:21.179
and protective gear
for healthcare workers.

00:11:21.179 --> 00:11:23.482
-A little advice for
the governors and the mayors.

00:11:23.482 --> 00:11:26.318
Take the blame when you have to.

00:11:26.318 --> 00:11:28.620
You know, if you play
with your boss,

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:31.356
sometimes it's better
if you don't win the golf game.

00:11:31.356 --> 00:11:35.327
Uh, he's the boss.
He's got all the resources.

00:11:35.327 --> 00:11:37.462
-Great. Thousands are dead,

00:11:37.462 --> 00:11:39.598
and Rudy's saying,
"Think of it like a golf game."

00:11:39.598 --> 00:11:41.933
And, no, he doesn't have
all the resources.

00:11:41.933 --> 00:11:43.369
We have all the resources.

00:11:43.369 --> 00:11:46.338
They're ours,
you outer borough gargoyle.

00:11:46.338 --> 00:11:48.006
We shouldn't have to be nice
to the president

00:11:48.006 --> 00:11:50.942
to get him to give us
lifesaving equipment.

00:11:50.942 --> 00:11:54.113
Besides, you don't have to try
very hard to lose to a guy

00:11:54.113 --> 00:11:55.681
who cheats like Trump does.

00:11:55.681 --> 00:11:57.849
I had a four on that one.
What about you, boss?

00:11:57.849 --> 00:12:02.221
[ As Trump ] I had a one.
Wait. Maybe a two.

00:12:02.221 --> 00:12:04.189
No, it was a one.

00:12:04.189 --> 00:12:05.557
[ Normal voice ] Trump's already
been impeached once.

00:12:05.557 --> 00:12:07.960
And now we're finding out
that he ignored

00:12:07.960 --> 00:12:09.928
repeated warnings
from intelligence officials

00:12:09.928 --> 00:12:11.997
and medical experts
about a deadly pandemic

00:12:11.997 --> 00:12:15.601
that's killed tens of thousands
and left millions unemployed.

00:12:15.601 --> 00:12:17.703
Looks like we'll have to find
a way through this nightmare

00:12:17.703 --> 00:12:19.171
without presidential
leadership...

00:12:19.171 --> 00:12:22.541
-Whether we like it or not.
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:12:22.541 --> 00:12:26.278
Wait. Who -- Who let you out?!

00:12:26.278 --> 00:12:28.113
Oh, not you, too!

00:12:28.113 --> 00:12:31.015
They're loose!
The boys are loose!

00:12:31.015 --> 00:12:33.752
[ Children giggling ]

00:12:33.752 --> 00:12:36.655
This has been "A Closer" --
[ Chuckles ]

00:12:36.655 --> 00:12:40.292
Oh, are you going back?
This has been "A Closer Look."

00:12:40.292 --> 00:12:44.162
♪♪

00:12:44.162 --> 00:12:46.431
-City Harvest
is New York City's largest

00:12:46.431 --> 00:12:47.899
food rescue organization,

00:12:47.899 --> 00:12:50.168
and now they're working hard
to support local families

00:12:50.168 --> 00:12:52.705
who are out of work
due to the COVID-19 pandemic.

00:12:52.705 --> 00:12:55.740
If you're watching this online,
please hit the "donate" button.

00:12:55.740 --> 00:12:58.277
Stay safe. Wash your hands.
We love you.

